ta-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"letters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lettered by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/AndWorld_Design\" title=\"AndWorld Design\">AndWorld Design</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 8, 2020</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #7</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #9</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #8</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on July 8, 2020 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the eighth issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series, the third issue of the five-part <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The House of Slaughter (comic arc)\">The House of Slaughter</a></i> arc, and the eighth issue of the fifteen-part <i>Archer's Peak</i> saga.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a>'s employers, the mysterious <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a>, have taken control of Archer's Peak and sealed it off from the outside world. But can they hope to quarantine the damage caused by the monsters... and Erica Slaughter?<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> awakens in the hospital, with <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh</a> sitting in his room. Joe admits to James that nothing makes sense to him, but that everyone seems to be against him at the moment. He asks for James to tell him about the \"aliens,\" and James corrects him that they're monsters. James says that he sort-of trusts Erica, that she doesn't seem to like the people she works for, and that she stabbed <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a> with something that made him see monsters. He asks if the Sheriff is okay, and Joe says that he is not.\n</p><p>At the police station, <a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a> asks <a href=\"/wiki/Gail\" title=\"Gail\">Gail</a> if she'd ever seen a dead body. Gail says that she had seen her father die, but felt that it was peaceful, as he was suddenly no longer in pain. Bian asks if anything tried to eat him, as <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a> enter and tell Bian they are going to leave. Against Aaron's wishes, Erica tells Bian that she can bring her drawing supplies. <a href=\"/wiki/John_Richards\" title=\"John Richards\">Officer Richards</a> then comes in with his gun drawn, telling Bian that she can take her markers if she comes with him instead. When Gail attempts to call the Sheriff, Aaron knocks her out, scaring Bian. Richards reveals he knows about their plan to use Bian as bait. Bian turns against Erica when she realizes Erica is going to hurt the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">child monsters</span>, as she sees them as only babies who don't know they're doing anything bad. Aaron charges for Richards, but Erica knocks him out. She allows Richards to take Bian, telling him to take her somewhere safe and hidden.\n</p><p>At the school, where the families are still waiting to identify their children, <a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Tim Cavanaugh\">Tim Cavanaugh</a> begins to speak. He tells them that they are going to check their names with <a href=\"/wiki/John_Collins\" title=\"John Collins\">Principal Collins</a>, and that he knows this is rough on everyone, but they need to understand each other's fear and have solidarity. Collins then asks for the family of <a href=\"/wiki/Alyssa_Dean\" title=\"Alyssa Dean\">Alyssa Dean</a> to come forward. Tommy remarks that this is going to take hours, and <a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">Ms. Mahoney</a> tells him to do something better than complain. Tommy calls <a href=\"/wiki/Tam\" title=\"Tam\">Tam</a> to get a ride out of town, but hangs up when he sees an Oscuratype in the woods.\n</p><p>Aaron awakens in the police station, angry at Erica. She tells him that she will get his bait, if he finds them a place to do the ritual. Aaron warns her that only one kill will make the monsters deadlier.\n</p><p>Tommy goes into the woods, and calls Tam, telling her to find Erica and tell her that the monsters are behind the school, and they got another kid. The Oscuratypes then descend on Tommy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Archer.27s_Peak\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Archer's_Peak\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Tim Cavanaugh\">Tim Cavanaugh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/John_Collins\" title=\"John Collins\">Principal John Collins</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gail\" title=\"Gail\">Gail</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">Ms. Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/John_Richards\" title=\"John Richards\">Officer John Richards</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\">Monsters</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratype\" title=\"Oscuratype\">Oscuratype</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comic_guide\">Comic guide</span></h2>\n<table class=\"navbar mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Expand\" data-collapsetext=\"Collapse\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border: 1px solid #8c8c8c; background:transparent; border-radius:4px; text-align:center;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background: var(--theme-sticky-nav-background-color); border-radius:4px;\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"height:3px; margin:0px 0px 0px 3px\"><div style=\"font-size:8pt\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Comic_(SIKTC)\" title=\"Template:Comic (SIKTC)\">v</a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://something-i